Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.43,0:00:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The lantern image may suggest that one sends an instant\Nmessage to the other That
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.82,0:00:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,interpretation is wrong Someone measuring one qubit\Ncannot freely choose the result to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.46,0:00:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,transmit a sentence Considered individually the outcomes\Nin this example appear random To
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,compare correlations people need to share information\Nthrough an ordinary channel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,respecting the usual limits of communication\NEntanglement is an important property of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,nature and can be a resource for quantum technologies\NBut it does not turn our forest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.58,0:00:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,into a telephone faster than light A metaphor should\Nhelp us understand without inventing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.15,0:00:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,a power that physics does not provide